<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VLSI, LSI Logic started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VLSI, LSI Logic started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it initiated coverage of VLSI Technology Inc and LSI Logic Corp as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- analyst Scott Nirembirski was not immediately available to provide additional details.</p>
<p>-- VLSI lost 1/16 to 24-13/16 and LSI Logic lost 1-3/8 to 41-5/8.</p>
</text>
